1. AI Training Prohibition / 禁止用于 AI 模型训练

   You may NOT use this Work, in whole or in part, as training data,
   fine-tuning data, embedding corpus, RAG knowledge base source, prompt
   engineering material, or any other input for developing, training,
   fine-tuning, evaluating, or benchmarking any machine learning model,
   large language model, or artificial intelligence system, whether for
   commercial or non-commercial purposes, WITHOUT the Author's prior
   written consent.

   未经作者事先书面同意，您不得将本作品的全部或任何部分用作训练数据、
   微调数据、向量库素材、RAG 知识库来源、提示词工程材料或任何其他输入，
   以开发、训练、微调、评估或基准测试任何机器学习模型、大语言模型或人工智能
   系统，无论用于商业或非商业目的。

   Note: This restriction does not prohibit end-users from **invoking** this
   Skill through their own agentic AI runtime (e.g., QoderWork, Cursor, Claude
   Code, etc.) for personal, non-commercial legal case analysis; it only
   prohibits ingesting the Work into model weights, embeddings, or fine-tuning
   pipelines.

   注：本条款不禁止终端用户在自己的 agentic AI 运行时（如 Cursor、
   Claude Code 等）中调用本 skill 进行个人、非商业的法律案例分析；仅禁止
   将本作品灌入模型权重、向量嵌入或微调管道。

2. Redistribution to Paid Platforms Prohibition / 禁止再分发到收费平台

   You may NOT upload, submit, or otherwise distribute this Work, in whole
   or in part, to any commercial marketplace, paid content repository, or
   subscription-gated platform (including but not limited to skill/plugin
   marketplaces of commercial AI IDEs, paywalled document platforms, and
   paid course platforms), whether or not the Work itself is offered for a
   fee on such platform.

   您不得将本作品的全部或任何部分上传、提交或以其他方式分发至任何商业市场、
   付费内容库或订阅制平台（包括但不限于商业 AI IDE 的技能/插件市场、付费文档
   平台、付费课程平台），无论本作品在该平台上是否单独收费。

3. Enterprise / Governmental Use Prohibition / 企业与行政机关使用限制

   Use of this Work by any legal person for internal enterprise legal
   operations, government administrative enforcement, judicial adjudication,
   or professional service delivery constitutes commercial use and requires
   a separate written enterprise license from the Author. Individual employees
   or officers using the Work purely for personal skill development on their
   own time are exempt.

   任何法人主体将本作品用于企业内部法务运营、行政机关执法办案、司法审判活动或
   专业服务交付的场景，均构成商业使用，须另行取得作者签发的书面企业授权协议。
   企业员工或行政机关工作人员在个人业余时间纯粹为提升个人技能而使用本作品
   的除外。

4. Academic Citation / 学术引用规范

   Academic use for classroom teaching, personal study, non-commercial
   research, and scholarly publication is permitted under the base CC
   BY-NC-ND 4.0 terms, provided that any citation in academic works uses
